{"id":3693,"date":"2022-03-17T15:31:33","date_gmt":"2022-03-17T15:31:33","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=3693"},"modified":"2023-01-18T10:05:22","modified_gmt":"2023-01-18T10:05:22","slug":"venue-and-useful-information","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/basel2023\/venue-and-useful-information\/","title":{"rendered":"Venue and Useful information"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Getting there<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">SWAT4HCLS 2023 will be held in Basel, Switzerland and online.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Venue address and its <a href=\"https:\/\/goo.gl\/maps\/ewK1NTzYv87bsNo18\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/goo.gl\/maps\/ewK1NTzYv87bsNo18\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Maps link<\/a>:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>Biozentrum, University of Basel<br>Spitalstrasse 41<br>CH - 4056 Basel<\/code><\/pre>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Requirements for entry<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can find information about <a href=\"https:\/\/www.sem.admin.ch\/sem\/en\/home\/publiservice\/weisungen-kreisschreiben\/visa\/liste1_staatsangehoerigkeit.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">ID or visa requirements to enter Switzerland<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Exchange rate<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A <a href=\"https:\/\/www.x-rates.com\/table\/?from=CHF&amp;amount=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Swiss Franc is worth<\/a> approximately \u20ac1.04 and $1.04.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Trains to Basel in Europe<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nsinternational.com\/en\/trains\/nighttrain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nightjet<\/a> &#8211; get there while you sleep<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nsinternational.com\/en\/trains\/ice-international\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ICE International<\/a><\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Airports<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.euroairport.com\/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">EuroAirport Basel-Mulhouse-Freiburg<\/a>&nbsp;<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.flughafen-zuerich.ch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Airport Zurich<\/a>&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Local train and bus connections<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Busstop: Kinderspital<\/li><li>Tramstop: Johanniterbr\u00fccke<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From the SBB train station<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Bus 30 direction Badischer Bahnhof to Kinderspital (9 min 5 stops)<\/li><li>Tram 14 direction \u201cSt-Louis Grenze\u201d to Johanniterbr\u00fccke (12min 7 Stops)<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Venue<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For participants who can join us in person, the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.biozentrum.unibas.ch\/\" target=\"_blank\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.biozentrum.unibas.ch\/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Biozentrum of the University of Basel<\/a> is located only a few 100 metres from the city centre and is easily accessible by public transport, car, bicycle and on foot.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"alignleft size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/csm_Biozentrum-aussen-2021_b4f3e92868.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/csm_Biozentrum-aussen-2021_b4f3e92868.jpg\" alt=\"Biozentrum of the University of Basel \" class=\"wp-image-3763\" width=\"425\" height=\"378\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/csm_Biozentrum-aussen-2021_b4f3e92868.jpg 850w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/csm_Biozentrum-aussen-2021_b4f3e92868-300x267.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/csm_Biozentrum-aussen-2021_b4f3e92868-768x683.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 425px) 100vw, 425px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/csm_051_Biozentrum_Daisuke-Hirabayashi_UNIBAS_WEB_001_68745efa79.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/csm_051_Biozentrum_Daisuke-Hirabayashi_UNIBAS_WEB_001_68745efa79-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3767\" width=\"384\" height=\"512\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/csm_051_Biozentrum_Daisuke-Hirabayashi_UNIBAS_WEB_001_68745efa79-768x1024.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/csm_051_Biozentrum_Daisuke-Hirabayashi_UNIBAS_WEB_001_68745efa79-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/csm_051_Biozentrum_Daisuke-Hirabayashi_UNIBAS_WEB_001_68745efa79.jpg 1010w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 384px) 100vw, 384px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>\u00a9 Daisuke-Hirabayashi<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About Basel<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A city with historical buildings next to modern architecture,&nbsp;nearly 40 museums,&nbsp;cosmopolitan ambience and lively traditions. Read more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.basel.com\/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">about Basel<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Basel-Panorama-bei-Abendd\u00e4mmerung-Basel-Panorama-at-dusk.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Basel-Panorama-bei-Abendd\u00e4mmerung-Basel-Panorama-at-dusk.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3787\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Rheingasse-Altstadt-Kleinbasel-Old-Town-Kleinbasel.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Rheingasse-Altstadt-Kleinbasel-Old-Town-Kleinbasel.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3788\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Werkraum-Warteck-pp-Basel.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Werkraum-Warteck-pp-Basel.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3789\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Rathaus-Basel-City-Hall-Basel.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Rathaus-Basel-City-Hall-Basel.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3790\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Rathaus-Basel-City-Hall-Basel.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Rathaus-Basel-City-Hall-Basel-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Rathaus-Basel-City-Hall-Basel-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Novartis-Campus-Basel.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Novartis-Campus-Basel.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3791\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Novartis-Campus-Basel.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Novartis-Campus-Basel-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Novartis-Campus-Basel-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><sub>Photo credits: <a href=\"https:\/\/mediagallery.basel.com\/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Basel mediagallery<\/a>.<\/sub><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Suggested hotels<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All the Hotels are in the walking distance from the venue.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.hoteld-basel.ch\/en\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">D-Hotel<\/a> &#8211; 4* (from 168 CHF night in single room including breakfast) &#8211; recommended<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.hotelrochat.ch\/#\" target=\"_blank\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.hotelrochat.ch\/#\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Hotel Rochat<\/a> &#8211; 3* (from 128 CHF night in single room including breakfast)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.odelya.ch\/en\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.odelya.ch\/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Odelya Hotel<\/a> &#8211; 3* (from 149 CHF night in single room including breakfast)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.hotelspalentor.ch\/?lang=en\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.hotelspalentor.ch\/?lang=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Hotel Spalentor<\/a> &#8211; 4* (from 146 CHF night in single room including breakfast)<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Getting there SWAT4HCLS 2023 will be held in Basel, Switzerland and online. The Venue address and its Google Maps link: Requirements for entry You can find information abou